    "text": "centralnebraskatoday.com\nwebsite\nGrand Island\nStolley Park Railroad ready to become Haunted Halloween Express\nBy City of Grand Island,\n1 days agoGRAND ISLAND — Halloween is just around the corner, and the Grand Island Parks and Recreation Department is excited to once again invite families to the Haunted Halloween Express at Stolley Park Railroad! The annual favorite will take place on Friday, October 17, from 6-10 p.m. and Saturday, October 18 from 5-10 p.m.\nRelated Topics\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nGreg Wilson, CFA\n·\nuser · 19.6K followers\n8 Foods You Can Eat A Lot Of Without Gaining Weight, According to a Dietitian\nKim Yawitz, RD, is a registered dietitian and gym owner in St. Louis, Mo. In addition to coaching fitness and nutrition clients one-on-one and in small groups, Kim also shares her expertise with national media outlets. She enjoys cooking, reading, and spending time with her family.\nSt. Louis, MO ·21d\nDianna Carney\n·\nuser · 35.7K followers\nThe HD Post\n·\nuser · 21.5K followers",
